<HelloFraandsPage title="Refund & cancellation" summary="Call ki dikkat ya galat charge ko jaldi report karein." review={true} related={[{"href":"/wallet-terms","label":"Wallet terms"},{"href":"/terms","label":"Terms of use"},{"href":"/grievance","label":"Grievance redressal"}]}>
<h2>Failed or dropped calls</h2>
<p>Failed connections and the affected portion of dropped calls are automatically credited to your wallet. Completed minutes are not refundable. If an expected credit is missing, send the call ID and payment details through <a href="/report">Report a user</a>.</p>
<h2>Ending a call</h2>
<p>You can end a call at any time. Charges for completed minutes still apply. There is no cancellation refund for time you have already used.</p>
<h2>Unused balance when you close your account</h2>
<p>You may request a refund of unused balance when closing your account, minus GST already paid, subject to applicable law. Approved refunds go to the original payment source in 7–10 days. Bank processing can affect when the credit appears.</p>
<p>Provide your registered contact details and transaction reference. Do not send an OTP, UPI PIN, or full card details. Balance forfeiture following a ban is covered by the <a href="/wallet-terms">wallet terms</a>.</p>
<aside class="help-crosslink"><p>Need help with a payment or refund? <a href="/help">Visit the help centre</a>.</p></aside>
<h2>Raise a dispute within 48 hours</h2>
<p>Use <a href="/report">Report a user</a> within 48 hours of the call or disputed charge. Include the call ID, time, amount, and what went wrong. We review the call and billing records. This reporting window does not remove any mandatory legal rights.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
